                                        "entry_id": "51739a0a-05cb-32ca-af1b-dc6c21453ad5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A paraphilia in which a person is sexually attracted to cartoon characters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92472558-ff45-4795-a4b2-aee790b50871",
                                                "sense_id": "0eba6605-2891-3fb9-bad2-fc806d7303d1",
                                                "text": "Crumb, as a cartoonist, also summons ideas of Schediaphilia"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11ce7921-fecb-4a16-a4a1-441d1369786a",
                                                "sense_id": "0eba6605-2891-3fb9-bad2-fc806d7303d1",
                                                "text": "And when I say “peak crescendo,” I mean a graphic, heated and relatively lengthy sex scene between two of characters sure to inspire many viewers to seek help for schediaphilia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3968ca78-1c4a-4073-90ce-cb7d4fdbe72c",
                                                "sense_id": "0eba6605-2891-3fb9-bad2-fc806d7303d1",
                                                "text": "We can also describe making love, bondage games, pedophilia, frotteurism, necrophilia, schediaphilia, autoerotic asphyxiation, and anthropophagolagnia as \"sexual' (just to give a few examples), but we would not assume those behaviors were categorically motivated by the same deesires or resulted in something humane or admirable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b93c66ad-7fe3-40e3-8453-664da4e40d07",
                                                "sense_id": "0eba6605-2891-3fb9-bad2-fc806d7303d1",
                                                "text": "(see title)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "75b5f090-24fe-4c1c-aecf-accaba528c16",
                        "source_entry_id": "df171413-113d-3c3c-824e-518fcb521c11",
